=== reading ===
beta-beta CROSSES the 4.20% ceiling and reaches each reference, so the ceiling
is not architectural -- front-loaded nucleation was. But watch two costs in
the table above: (1) the k_nuc that lifts beta-beta also raises monomer-
monomer beta-5/beta-1 and multiplies n_frags; (2) chi2 vs k_nuc = 0 shows
whether closing beta-beta with a SINGLE global k_nuc helps or hurts the
whole inventory. A refit (k_nuc as an 8th free parameter) is the next step
only if the sweep shows chi2 improving at the beta-beta-closing k_nuc.
